The rat motor neurone has an impulse transmission speed of $50\text{ m s}^{-1}$. The snail motor neurone has an impulse transmission speed of $8\text{ m s}^{-1}$.

Explain why the rat motor neurone has a faster impulse transmission speed than the snail motor neurone.

